 proposal={'status':'PROPOSED_NEW_RESIDUAL_PROFILE_NOT_AUTHORIZED_NOT_RUN','reason':'Original four parallel shards reached the unchanged900second cap after50457 durable canonical rows. This proposes new finite residual work, not continuation/refund of the old ledger.','original_terminal_preserved':True,'original_verified_rows':50457,'canonical_candidates':89758,'missing_records':39301,'missing_manifest_sha256':sha(missing),'original_verification_receipt_sha256':sha(V/'independent-union-block-verification.json'),'prefix_diagnosis_sha256':sha(V/'prefix-and-cost-diagnosis.json'),'canonical_manifest_sha256':'7ff5023543d3f69ce1963ee0b0f7e15fc60eaad6e28896aa7556251dd379a6bd','proposed_output':'m2-intake/wikibooks-residual-render-v1 (must not exist)','jobs':jobs,'scheduling':'Two explicit waves, four workers concurrently per wave; no replacement attempt on failure. Each job processes only its frozen missing ordinals and verifies original source frame hashes. Re-reading archive prefixes is allowed; no already committed ordinal is re-rendered or recounted.','proposed_limits':{'jobs_total':8,'attempts_per_job':1,'seconds_per_job':900,'reserved_job_seconds_total':7200,'joint_wall_per_wave_seconds':930,'joint_wall_all_waves_seconds':1860,'observed_RSS_per_worker_bytes':1000000000,'observed_owned_tree_RSS_per_wave_bytes':4000000000,'output_bytes_per_job':1000000000,'combined_output_reservation_bytes':8000000000,'actual_decoded_bytes_per_job':12000000000,'parsed_record_bytes':4194304,'members':64,'free_disk_floor_bytes':20*1024**3,'weights_reserved_bytes':16000000000,'combined_intake_ceiling_bytes':64000000000},'clock':'explicit time.clock_gettime(time.CLOCK_MONOTONIC), supervisors bound to live parent start','approval_needed':'Parent must review and separately dispatch this new profile. Existing caps/ledgers/results remain immutable. No code execution authorized by this proposal.','latency_caveat':'No per-record latency instrumentation exists in the completed attempt. Planning uses measured aggregate wall/committed row, multiplies by1.25 and adds90seconds for repeated scans/verification. Workload variation can still cause terminal partials; no completion guarantee, cap increase or retry.','implementation_requirements':['Pin renderer/cleanup/source/canonical/old recovered-copy hashes and each residual manifest.','Instrument actual source scan, DOM, render, SQLite/guard timings and bounded slow-record metadata for diagnosis.','Serialized durable one-shot reservations before each worker; terminate and reap all owned worker groups on global stop.','Bound individual DOM work by supervisor; batch commit and retain rollback journals on any terminal event.','After terminal independently verify original50457 plus residual disjoint exact union against89758canonical ordinals, source identities, every fulltext/block hash and no doublecount.','Require source EOF/CRC verification from the final residual archive traversal or independently pinned complete identity frame; do not infer from range exit.','Global family/block/exact duplicate/language/rights/leakage and fresh representative review remain pending.'],'admitted_documents':0,'admitted_tokens':0}
